#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_200.md:129
msgid ""
"When using **Firmware v1.68 and earlier**, each FX pad will send multiple "
"and different Note and CC messages. As these could not all be used properly "
"with Mixxx current effect framework, a simplified configuration was assigned"
" using the pad in {hwlabel}`SHIFT` mode for convenience."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_200.md:137
msgid "{hwlabel}`SHIFT` + Pad 1 - 3"
