#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_djcontrol_inpulse_200.md:145
msgid ""
"However, after applying **Firmware v1.72**, each FX pad now sends a simple "
"Note On/Note Off (as is the case in every other Pad mode). This makes it "
"easier to use the pads to control effect and the latest mapping take "
"advantage of this possibility by removing the use of the {hwlabel}`SHIFT` "
"button."
msgstr ""

